HST Office: the Sheets ribbon's "Sheet Options" launcher (Bố trí trang > Tùy chọn trang tính ↘) opens Page Setup on
the Sheet tab ("Trang tính"), as the spreadsheet market leader's does; it used to open on the Page tab.

- PageFormatDialog gets an optional Page argument (as ParagraphDialog and BorderDialog have); the launcher sends
  .uno:PageFormatDialog?Page:string=sheet. Without the argument the dialog still opens on the page tab, and a call
  with any other argument keeps its old meaning (no dialog).

